=2 Walkthrough
* Make sure you possess the {k:Map of the Quicksand Caves} before you start! This is **required**.
* Head to {z:Western Altepa Desert} (D-12) or use {p:Geomagnetic Fount} Waypoint to get to {z:Quicksand Caves} map 5.
** If you took the {p:Geomagnetic Fount} waypoint, you are already on the correct map. Do not fall into the hole next to you. Go east and make a right after the door. The {n:Goblin Geologist} is at the zone entrance at (J-11).
** Alternatively use {z:Quicksand Caves} Home Point #1 for the {z:Chamber of Oracles} and exit out from exit 5 of map 5 at (H-4) to {z:Western Altepa Desert}. Once out go south towards the hidden area of (D-12) that will bring you straight to the goblin at entrance 4.

!Western Altepa Desert.jpg||
!Quicksand Caves-map5.jpg||Quicksand Caves map 5
* Speak to the {n:Goblin Geologist} at (J-11), he will ask you to gather 9 {p:Key Items|Key Item} from **???** spots scattered around the Quicksand Caves.
** {@k} {k:Stone of Surya}
** {@k} {k:Stone of Chandra}
** {@k} {k:Stone of Mangala}
** {@k} {k:Stone of Budha}
** {@k} {k:Stone of Brihaspati}
** {@k} {k:Stone of Shukra}
** {@k} {k:Stone of Shani}
** {@k} {k:Stone of Rahu}
** {@k} {k:Stone of Ketu}
* The Goblin will mark the locations on your map, so if you do not possess a {@k} {k:Map of the Quicksand Caves} you will be unable to proceed with the mission. The markers will appear in the green Markers section.
** Due to the markers being saved locally and being random from a select pool of options it is advisable to finish the mission on the same PC you started this step in, in one go, or to make a backup/upload of the data.
** The markers **do not clear** after being collected so make sure to remember the ones you already got or you'll have to check them all again.
** You can use the "Change Map" option to check the green Markers in other maps and plan which entrances you may need to use.
* The following entrances can contain the needed **???**:

>**Western Altepa Desert:**
* (G-5) Entrance 6 to Quicksand Caves Map 5
** Best reached by taking {p:Survival Guide} to {z:Kuftal Tunnel} and zoning out to {z:Western Altepa Desert}.
* (J-9) Entrance 2 to Quicksand Caves maps 3 and 4. Either map may contain ???s.
** This entrance can quickly be reached by taking unity warp 125 to {z:Western Altepa Desert}.
** Map 4 can be reached by going to (D-11) on Map 3, exit C.

>**Eastern Altepa Desert:**
!Quicksand Caves-map3.jpg||Quicksand Caves map 3
!Quicksand Caves-map4.jpg||Quicksand Caves map 4
* (K-7) Entrance 1 to Quicksand Caves Map 1
** Unity warp 125 to Quicksand Caves will take you there directly.
* (H-10) Entrance 4 to Quicksand Caves Map 2
** {p:Survival Guide} to {z:Eastern Altepa Desert} will get you close to the entrance.

!Eastern Altepa Desert - Map.jpg||Eastern Altepa Desert Map
!Quicksand Caves-map1.jpg||Quicksand Caves map 1
!Quicksand Caves-map2.jpg||Quicksand Caves map 2
* These can require multiple one-way drops to reach, you should consider having an easy way to return to {z:Eastern Altepa Desert} such as {s:Teleport-Altep} and {i:Instant Warp|Instant Warp|4181} to get out of the maps/fix mistakes as needed, unless you want to walk through the maps.
** The {z:Quicksand Caves} Home Point #2 can be useful for some of these, as it brings you on Map 1 just outside of the {z:Cloister of Tremors}, also conveniently near Exit 3. Consider grabbing it on the way if you don't have it.
* Once you return to the Goblin Geologist with all nine stones, you will receive a {@k} {k:Navaratna talisman}.
* Enter the {z:Chamber of Oracles} and examine the **Shimmering Circle** for the cutscene that completes this mission.
** {z:Quicksand Caves} {p:Home Point} #1 is just outside the Chamber of Oracles. It's a great time to unlock it if you don't have it already.
** If you have completed the {q:Open Sesame|Open Sesame|Open Sesame} quest for the {@k} {k:Loadstone} or you're a Galka, you can use the pressure pads to make your way to the Chamber of Oracles solo. Otherwise, you would need to stand on the pressure pads with other players (Trusts do not count): 3 Tarutaru or any combination of 2 of Hume/Elvaan/Mithra.
** Path from {n:Goblin Geologist} to {z:Chamber of Oracles}:
*** Go to (I-9) and step on the weight pad and go through the door.
*** Go west to (H-7) and use another weight pad to pass through a door.
*** In the next room, drop down the hole to a hidden area.
*** Head to (D-4) to zone in to the Chamber of Oracles.

=2 Notes
* None of the **???** require using the weight switches to open any door, but it is recommended you do the {q:Open Sesame|Open Sesame|Open Sesame} quest for the {@k} {k:Loadstone} if you haven't attuned to {z:Quicksand Caves} Home Point #1 and #2 as it a convenient time to do this.

